---
description: "How to find and fix a bug in this codebase"
alwaysApply: false
---

## Approach
1. Explain where in the code the bug likely lives and why
2. Wait for confirmation before writing any code
3. Fix in the minimum lines — prefer upstream fix over downstream workaround
4. Add a regression test that would have caught this bug

## Constraints
- Do not refactor unrelated code
- The fix must not break any currently passing tests
